<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Learn to plant various alchemical ingredients and combining them into different draughts at an alchemy lab.-->
  <VFEM2_Alchemy.description>在炼金实验室学习种植各种炼金成分并将它们组合成不同的草稿。</VFEM2_Alchemy.description>
  <VFEM2_Alchemy.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->alchemical studies-->
    <li>subject-&gt;炼金术研究</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->unlocked the mysteries of transmutation and concocted potent elixirs-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;解开了嬗变的奥秘并调制出了强效的灵丹妙药</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->discovered a rare herb, rumored to grant eternal youth-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;发现了一种稀有草药，据说可以永葆青春</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->became a feared poisoner, selling deadly brews to the highest bidder-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;成为令人畏惧的投毒者，将致命的啤酒卖给最高出价者</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->brewing alchemical draughts-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;酿造炼金草稿</li>
  </VFEM2_Alchemy.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: alchemy-->
  <VFEM2_Alchemy.label>炼金术</VFEM2_Alchemy.label>
  <!--EN: Learn how to keep bees to produce honey from nearby plants. Honey can be used in creation of sweetrolls and mead.-->
  <VFEM2_Beekeeping.description>了解如何饲养蜜蜂从附近的植物中生产蜂蜜。蜂蜜可用于制作甜卷和蜂蜜酒。</VFEM2_Beekeeping.description>
  <VFEM2_Beekeeping.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->apiculture-->
    <li>subject-&gt;养蜂业</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->studied the intricate social structures of bees-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;研究了蜜蜂复杂的社会结构</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->cultivated vast apiaries, supplying nobles with the finest honey-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;培育了巨大的养蜂场，为贵族提供最好的蜂蜜</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->perfected the art of mead-making, becoming a renowned brewer-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;完善了蜂蜜酒酿造艺术，成为著名的酿酒师</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->tending to beehives-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;照料蜂箱</li>
  </VFEM2_Beekeeping.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: beekeeping-->
  <VFEM2_Beekeeping.label>养蜂业</VFEM2_Beekeeping.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build various tools and devices to enhance the productivity of the workbenches.-->
  <VFEM2_ComplexWorkshops.description>学习构建各种工具和设备以提高工作台的生产力。</VFEM2_ComplexWorkshops.description>
  <VFEM2_ComplexWorkshops.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->advanced craftsmanship-->
    <li>subject-&gt;先进工艺</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->refined blacksmithing techniques, crafting tools of unmatched quality-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精湛的锻造技术，品质无与伦比的制作工具</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced mechanical innovations that revolutionized production-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;推出了彻底改变生产的机械创新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->formed a powerful guild, controlling the flow of masterwork goods-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;组建了强大的公会，控制了杰作商品的流通</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->improving workshop efficiency-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;提高车间效率</li>
  </VFEM2_ComplexWorkshops.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: complex workshops-->
  <VFEM2_ComplexWorkshops.label>复杂的车间</VFEM2_ComplexWorkshops.label>
  <!--EN: Adorn the colors of your faction and construct decorative banners and heraldic rugs.-->
  <VFEM2_Heraldry.description>装饰你的派系的颜色并建造装饰横幅和纹章地毯。</VFEM2_Heraldry.description>
  <VFEM2_Heraldry.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->heraldic traditions-->
    <li>subject-&gt;纹章传统</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed banners that struck fear or awe into the hearts of foes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计的横幅让敌人心中充满恐惧或敬畏</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted family crests, immortalizing legacies in fabric and stone-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心制作的家族徽章，用织物和石材永垂不朽</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->led the creation of a grand hall adorned with noble insignia-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;领导建造了一座装饰着贵族徽章的宏伟大厅</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->designing heraldic symbols-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;设计纹章符号</li>
  </VFEM2_Heraldry.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: heraldry-->
  <VFEM2_Heraldry.label>纹章</VFEM2_Heraldry.label>
  <!--EN: Craft ancient, chempowder operated ranged weapons that utilise the matchlock mechanics, such as arquebuses and hand cannons.-->
  <VFEM2_Matchlocks.description>制作利用火绳枪机制的古老化学火药远程武器，例如火绳枪和手炮。</VFEM2_Matchlocks.description>
  <VFEM2_Matchlocks.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->early firearms-->
    <li>subject-&gt;早期枪支</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->perfected the art of matchlock guns, bringing an age of gunpowder warfare-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;完善了火绳枪的艺术，带来了火药战争的时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->supplied mercenaries with devastating ranged weaponry-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为雇佣兵提供毁灭性的远程武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->unleashed fire and thunder on the battlefield, changing warfare forever-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在战场上释放火与雷，改变战争永远</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->crafting matchlock firearms-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;制作火绳枪</li>
  </VFEM2_Matchlocks.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: matchlocks-->
  <VFEM2_Matchlocks.label>火绳枪</VFEM2_Matchlocks.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to construct various medieval structures, including cloth walls.-->
  <VFEM2_MedievalArchitecture.description>学习建造各种中世纪建筑，包括布墙。</VFEM2_MedievalArchitecture.description>
  <VFEM2_MedievalArchitecture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->medieval construction-->
    <li>subject-&gt;中世纪建筑</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->oversaw the construction of towering castles and bustling townships-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;监督了高耸的城堡和繁华的城镇的建设</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered grand cathedrals, marvels of medieval craftsmanship-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的宏伟大教堂，中世纪工艺的奇迹</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed secret passages and fortifications for clandestine schemes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为秘密计划开发了秘密通道和防御工事</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->designing medieval structures-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;设计中世纪建筑</li>
  </VFEM2_MedievalArchitecture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: medieval architecture-->
  <VFEM2_MedievalArchitecture.label>中世纪建筑</VFEM2_MedievalArchitecture.label>
  <!--EN: Plant grapes which can then be used to create wine must and eventually, high quality wine.-->
  <VFEM2_Wine.description>种植葡萄，然后可以用来酿造葡萄酒原汁，并最终酿造出高品质的葡萄酒。</VFEM2_Wine.description>
  <VFEM2_Wine.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->viniculture-->
    <li>subject-&gt;葡萄栽培</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->established a flourishing vineyard on the sun-kissed slopes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在阳光明媚的山坡上建立了一个繁茂的葡萄园</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->experimented with fermentation techniques, crafting exquisite vintages-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;试验发酵技术，酿造精美的年份酒</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->became infamous for a revelry-fueled dynasty of wine merchants-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;因酒商狂欢王朝而声名狼藉</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->cultivating grapes and fermenting wine-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;种植葡萄并发酵葡萄酒</li>
  </VFEM2_Wine.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: wine-->
  <VFEM2_Wine.label>葡萄酒</VFEM2_Wine.label>
</LanguageData>
